WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.163 --> 00:00:00.996
You look beautiful.

00:00:00.996 --> 00:00:02.971
That's a great outfit.
Thank you!

00:00:02.971 --> 00:00:04.609
It's not a dress, it's not pants.

00:00:04.609 --> 00:00:05.722
It's kind of a onesie.

00:00:05.722 --> 00:00:07.647
It's a onesie.
For an adult, yeah.

00:00:07.647 --> 00:00:09.313
It looks great.
Thank you.

00:00:09.313 --> 00:00:10.146
It looks like a little
bit of a throwback, too.

00:00:10.146 --> 00:00:10.979
Am I wrong?

00:00:10.979 --> 00:00:11.812
It's got kind of a 70's thing going on.

00:00:12.974 --> 00:00:14.640
It's very retro.
[Conan] Yeah.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:15.637
I'm so glad you like it.

00:00:15.637 --> 00:00:16.666
[Conan] Yeah, I really like it.

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:18.499
I was really excited to come.

00:00:18.499 --> 00:00:19.696
I'm like a Conan virgin.

00:00:19.696 --> 00:00:22.920
I've never been on the show
before, so I was excited.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.586
(crowd cheers)
Yeah?

00:00:24.586 --> 00:00:25.535
(both laugh)

00:00:25.535 --> 00:00:26.952
I make women sad.

00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:33.039
(laughing)
(clapping)

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:34.798
Yeah. Well, thank you so much-
Thank you!

00:00:34.798 --> 00:00:36.470
for being here on this
auspicious occasion.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:37.652
I know you're also excited-

00:00:37.652 --> 00:00:40.065
I'm told you're a big
Johnny Knoxville fan,

00:00:40.065 --> 00:00:41.561
big fan of Jackass.

00:00:41.561 --> 00:00:43.227
I am.
(laughs) Hi.

00:00:43.227 --> 00:00:45.143
You're such a jackass. I love it.

00:00:45.143 --> 00:00:45.976
Oh, thank you.
It's so great.

00:00:45.976 --> 00:00:49.647
Yeah, I'm kind of - I
like daredevil stuff, so-

00:00:49.647 --> 00:00:50.480
Oh yeah?

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.002
I get very excited, yeah.

00:00:52.002 --> 00:00:54.764
(all laugh)

00:00:54.764 --> 00:00:56.134
I don't know where this is going now.

00:00:56.134 --> 00:00:57.809
(crowd laughs)

00:00:57.809 --> 00:00:59.675
I actually had a little bit of a

00:00:59.675 --> 00:01:02.139
jackass moment myself last year.

00:01:02.139 --> 00:01:03.313
Do you want to hear it?
Yeah!

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:05.036
Did someone hit you in
the face with a fish?

00:01:05.036 --> 00:01:07.710
No, that was not my moment.

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:09.194
No, it was actually in
the Dominican Republic

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:11.085
about a year ago, or a couple years ago,

00:01:11.085 --> 00:01:13.725
with my co-star, Johnny
Galecki from the show,

00:01:13.725 --> 00:01:16.825
and we decided to rent Vespas,

00:01:16.825 --> 00:01:17.787
and I was so excited.

00:01:17.787 --> 00:01:20.159
He was driving it and I was in the back,

00:01:20.159 --> 00:01:21.808
but I said, you know,
"I want to drive it".

00:01:21.808 --> 00:01:22.641
And he goes, "Okay".

00:01:22.641 --> 00:01:24.822
And they don't care if
you wear helmets there

00:01:24.822 --> 00:01:26.586
or any sort of, you know-

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:27.419
[Johnny] Yeah.
[Conan] Right.

00:01:27.419 --> 00:01:30.014
I know you don't, either,
but they don't care.

00:01:30.014 --> 00:01:32.436
But you should care.
Yeah, but I don't care.

00:01:32.436 --> 00:01:33.522
So I'm like, "Great!"

00:01:33.522 --> 00:01:35.118
So I get on, we get the Vespa.

00:01:35.118 --> 00:01:37.295
I'm in the front and I am driving around.

00:01:37.295 --> 00:01:39.718
I'm so excited, on these little roads,

00:01:39.718 --> 00:01:41.767
and I crashed us so bad.

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:43.902
This wall came out of nowhere.

00:01:43.902 --> 00:01:45.202
(crowd laughs)

00:01:45.202 --> 00:01:47.569
It wasn't even a person or a car.

00:01:47.569 --> 00:01:50.260
It was just a wall, but it was kind of-

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:51.093
They're hard to turn.

00:01:51.093 --> 00:01:53.169
Yeah, it happens a lot.

00:01:53.169 --> 00:01:54.152
[Conan] Yeah.
Yeah, so they were-

00:01:54.152 --> 00:01:54.985
(crowd laughs)

00:01:54.985 --> 00:01:56.299
[Conan] I love that you're
complaining to Johnny Knoxville

00:01:56.299 --> 00:01:57.822
about your accident.

00:01:57.822 --> 00:01:59.387
I'm on your side.

00:01:59.387 --> 00:02:01.902
This man has had dildos shot at him.

00:02:01.902 --> 00:02:02.797
He doesn't care.

00:02:02.797 --> 00:02:04.616
I lost a tooth to one.

00:02:04.616 --> 00:02:05.799
Anyway, I crashed us really bad.

00:02:05.799 --> 00:02:07.441
And that was my one jackass moment.

00:02:07.441 --> 00:02:08.918
But it was, it was pretty intense.

00:02:08.918 --> 00:02:09.900
We both fell off,

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.189
the bike landed on me.

00:02:12.189 --> 00:02:13.574
I'm getting sort of an impression

00:02:13.574 --> 00:02:15.852
that you do like, the bad boys then?

00:02:15.852 --> 00:02:18.409
Are you one of those women
that, that drifts that way?

00:02:18.409 --> 00:02:20.837
I do, I tend to go for the bad boy.

00:02:20.837 --> 00:02:24.444
The tattooed kind of bad-ass jackass

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:25.869
sort of,

00:02:25.869 --> 00:02:27.636
you know, bad guy.

00:02:27.636 --> 00:02:28.469
[Andy] The Vespa riders.

00:02:28.469 --> 00:02:30.410
(crowd laughs)

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:32.077
yeah, the bad boys

00:02:32.077 --> 00:02:33.579
A guy that's in a Vespa gang.

00:02:33.579 --> 00:02:36.400
(Conan makes Vespa sounds)

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.731
We're coming to your towns.

00:02:37.731 --> 00:02:39.785
(Conan makes Vespa sounds)

00:02:39.785 --> 00:02:41.861
We'll be there in a long time.
I like the tattoos.

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:42.727
It's the tattoos.

00:02:42.727 --> 00:02:43.586
Do you have any tattoos?

00:02:43.586 --> 00:02:44.510
Do I have any tattoos?

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:45.610
Yeah?

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:46.443
No, I do not.

00:02:46.443 --> 00:02:47.491
None? None under there?

00:02:47.491 --> 00:02:48.324
None under where?

00:02:48.324 --> 00:02:49.582
Oh, no I was just wondering (laughs)

00:02:49.582 --> 00:02:51.608
They'd be obscured by freckle.

00:02:51.608 --> 00:02:52.458
I like yours.

00:02:52.458 --> 00:02:53.349
(Crowd laughs)

00:02:53.349 --> 00:02:54.182
[Johnny] Thank you.

00:02:54.182 --> 00:02:56.082
That was a scary one he had in his arm.

00:02:56.082 --> 00:02:56.915
[Conan] I don't know.

00:02:56.915 --> 00:02:57.748
See, she liked it.

00:02:57.748 --> 00:02:58.581
Yeah, no, no I love nothing.

00:02:58.581 --> 00:02:59.640
I think tattoos are really cool.

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:01.355
I just think I'm one of those
guys that can't pull it off.

00:03:01.355 --> 00:03:02.481
[Kaley] Yeah, no I understand.

00:03:02.481 --> 00:03:03.734
Well, that's not nice.

00:03:03.734 --> 00:03:06.901
(crowd laughs loudly)

00:03:08.006 --> 00:03:09.072
I was just hoping you were going to say-

00:03:09.072 --> 00:03:11.502
Kaley why cant you say,
"No, no, you'd be so hot."

00:03:11.502 --> 00:03:13.530
(crowd laughs)

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:15.924
Why did you have to say, "Oh
yeah, no, I completely get it."

00:03:15.924 --> 00:03:17.364
No, I thought maybe-

00:03:17.364 --> 00:03:19.679
That you doing a manly
thing just doesn't work.

00:03:19.679 --> 00:03:23.529
No, I thought maybe you had
them secretly underneath,

00:03:23.529 --> 00:03:24.981
