00:03:24.981 --> 00:03:26.414
not on your hands or...

00:03:26.414 --> 00:03:27.611
(crowd laughs)

00:03:27.611 --> 00:03:30.216
Well, most people do have them underneath,

00:03:30.216 --> 00:03:31.049
