00:03:31.049 --> 00:03:32.015
Andy, you don't have a tattoo?

00:03:32.015 --> 00:03:34.235
No, no, no. I can't make
up my mind about things.

00:03:34.235 --> 00:03:35.068
(crowd laughs)

00:03:35.068 --> 00:03:36.264
[Conan] That's a big commitment.

00:03:36.264 --> 00:03:38.230
I always would think like,

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.251
