00:03:57.377 --> 00:03:59.188
Yeah because, I don't even
know who Air Supply is.

00:03:59.188 --> 00:04:00.021
[Conan] Exactly.

00:04:00.021 --> 00:04:02.604
(crowd laughs)

00:04:03.917 --> 00:04:05.648
Well let me tell you about Air Supply.

00:04:05.648 --> 00:04:07.611
