00:04:34.814 --> 00:04:36.272
Now, I understand that...

00:04:36.272 --> 00:04:37.536
Okay. So you're not a good driver are you?

00:04:37.536 --> 00:04:38.803
Because you guys shoot
around here on this lot.

00:04:38.803 --> 00:04:40.856
